  "title": "I’m Sorry, That’s All Right",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-08-08",
  "synopsis": "Lucy spills some coffee on a guy at the dormitories.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1119/7ba0e0740088ea75c2a499eee97e1e8c84148358.mp3?1565001313",
  "series": {
