      "english": "I’m Sorry, That’s All Right"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "露西：对不起，对不起！你的衣服……我的咖啡……",
      "traditional": "露西：對不起，對不起！你的衣服……我的咖啡……",
      "pinyin": "lù xī duì bu qǐ duì bu qǐ nǐ de yī fu wǒ de kā fēi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I’m sorry, I’m sorry! Your shirt… My coffee…"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "帅哥：没关系！我的衣服回去洗洗就好。",
      "traditional": "帥哥：沒關係！我的衣服回去洗洗就好。",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē méi guān xi wǒ de yī fu huí qù xǐ xi jiù hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome guy: That’s all right! I’ll wash the shirt after I get back and it will be fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "露西：我来洗吧！",
      "traditional": "露西：我來洗吧！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wǒ lái xǐ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I will wash them!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "帅哥：不用了。",
      "traditional": "帥哥：不用了。",
      "pinyin": "shuài gē bú yòng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Handsome guy: Please don’t bother."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "露西：要的，要的。能把你的电话号码给我吗？我洗好了打电话给你。",
      "traditional": "露西：要的，要的。能把你的電話號碼給我嗎？我洗好了打電話給你。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī yào de yào de néng bǎ nǐ de diàn huà hào mǎ gěi wǒ ma wǒ xǐ hǎo le dǎ diàn huà gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I want to, I want to. Can you give me your phone number? I’ll call you when I’ve washed it."
    },
    {
